// the whole set, near 0.2953 + 0.0205i in Elephant Valley, where the main
// body's edge sprouts a procession of trunk-like spirals. On the way down,
// spirals open into smaller spirals, until the mini Mandelbrot at the bottom
// fills the view, and the whole picture starts over. (For a crisp mini,
// choose a higher Step limit and raise detail.)
//
