// (semi-implicit Euler: rabbits first, then foxes from the new rabbit count,
// which keeps the cycles from growing or dying away). Whole numbers only, so
// populations are in thousandths and the four rates in hundredths. Animate a
// rate to watch the cycles stretch and squeeze. The Iterations slider sets
// how long the simulation runs.
//
